00:24:10,273 --> 00:24:14,973
願わくばディスコで 親父と母さんが会った日に行きたいね
If possible, I'd like to go to the day Mom and Dad met at the disco.

324
00:24:14,973 --> 00:24:21,173
後ろのジョックスに酒 かけて息子じきじきにチャンス作ってやるぜ
I'll spill a drink on the jocks behind them and make a chance myself as their son.

325
00:24:21,873 --> 00:24:25,473
どんなでかい時計だってすべてさ
No matter how big the clock is,

326
00:24:25,473 --> 00:24:28,573
始まりはこんな小さい歯車
it all begins with a tiny gear like this.

327
00:24:28,573 --> 00:24:31,573
細かいことはもういいや 疲れた
I'm done with the fine details, I'm tired.

328
00:24:31,573 --> 00:24:35,773
別に怒ってないってさ 未来は
It's not mad at us at all—the future, that is.

329
00:24:47,073 --> 00:24:50,073
人はこれって時にどうしても
When people face moments like this, no matter what,

330
00:24:50,073 --> 00:24:52,973
「時間を戻せたら」とかいうね
they always say, "If only I could turn back time."

331
00:24:53,073 --> 00:24:56,773
でも誰も直せないよ 治せないんだな
But no one can fix it, it just can't be helped.

332
00:24:56,973 --> 00:25:00,773
昔からそうだし まぁしょうがないね
It's always been that way, so it is what it is.

333
00:25:00,119 --> 00:25:02,919
きっと先は深くて不安定
Surely what lies ahead is deep and uncertain,

334
00:25:02,919 --> 00:25:06,519
でも お行儀よくちゃ つまんないね
but being on our best behavior is no fun.

335
00:25:06,519 --> 00:25:08,919
タイムマシーンに乗り込んで
If we could board the time machine

336
00:25:08,919 --> 00:25:11,919
トラベラーになれたら
and become time travelers...

337
00:25:46,119 --> 00:25:50,119
Forever Young

338
00:25:57,719 --> 00:25:58,819
Yo

339
00:25:58,819 --> 00:26:03,119
シボレーのドアを蹴り開けて 街に飛び出した俺達
Kicking open the Chevy's door, we charged out into the city.

340
00:26:03,119 --> 00:26:07,619
暴力 酒に女 音楽 中指立てる大人の仮面にゃ
Violence, booze, women, music—flipping off the masks that adults wear.

341
00:26:07,819 --> 00:26:11,919
Oh さぁ踊ろう 「今日」という日を生き急ぐメンバー
Oh, let's dance! A crew rushing to live out "today."

342
00:26:11,919 --> 00:26:16,919
足りねぇか？ Little louder ! 欲望渦巻く路上が現場
Not enough? Little louder! The streets swirling with desire are our scene!

343
00:26:16,919 --> 00:26:21,919
Yeah いつだってそうだろ ブルハ 尾崎 永ちゃんが教科書
Yeah, it's always been like that—The Blue Hearts, Ozaki, and E-chan were our textbooks.

344
00:26:21,919 --> 00:26:26,619
くたばるまで格好つけてぇ 誓ったよあの放課後
We swore that afternoon after school we'd keep acting cool until we drop!

345
00:26:26,819 --> 00:26:30,919
俺らピーターパン 「またいつか」なんて言っちゃいかん
We're Peter Pan, don't you dare say "maybe someday"!

346
00:26:30,919 --> 00:26:35,619
嘲笑っとる大人に言ってやらぁ 人生はたったの一回だ
Let's tell those sneering adults: you only get one life!

347
00:26:36,119 --> 00:26:42,119
Ah 胸の奥底 初期衝動
Ah, deep within our chest, that primal impulse...

348
00:26:42,119 --> 00:26:45,419
見て見ぬフリ No, no
Pretending not to notice—no, no!

349
00:26:45,419 --> 00:26:49,619
夢追い 笑われ 傷だらけでギラつく My way
Chasing dreams, laughed at, covered in scars, glaring bright—my way!

350
00:26:49,619 --> 00:26:52,619
Go on! You should know who we are

351
00:26:52,619 --> 00:26:55,319
Forever Young

352
00:26:55,319 --> 00:26:57,919
Hey! Just next to me from now

353
00:26:57,919 --> 00:27:02,119
大切なことは魂の状態
what matters most is the state of your soul!

354
00:27:02,119 --> 00:27:04,319
Forever Young

355
00:27:04,319 --> 00:27:06,919
Hey! It's your turn next time from here

356
00:27:06,919 --> 00:27:09,619
「あの日始めれば良かった」
"I should have started back on that day"—

357
00:27:09,619 --> 00:27:13,619
その次の始めるべき時は今
the next best time to start is right now!

358
00:27:13,619 --> 00:27:17,919
高笑いする都会の喧騒 ウケ狙いならば振り向けれんぞ
The booming laughter of the city's hustle—if you're just playing for cheap laughs, you can't turn heads!

359
00:27:17,919 --> 00:27:22,619
何連呼？ 忘れろ？ 夢流した便所 見下ろしてきやがる摩天楼
Repeating what? Forget it? Skyscrapers looking down on the toilet where dreams were flushed!

360
00:27:22,619 --> 00:27:27,319
Oh まるで勝新みたく破天荒 伝説へとアテンド
Oh, wild and unprecedented just like Katsu Shin, escorted on the way to legend!

361
00:27:27,319 --> 00:27:29,919
怖にゃあ怖にゃあてその程度
If you're scared, then that's all you'll ever amount to.

362
00:27:29,919 --> 00:27:32,519
捨てろ負け惜しみ 過去の栄光
Throw away sore loser excuses and past glories!

363
00:27:32,519 --> 00:27:36,119
永遠なんぞはねぇて いつか天へ召され
There's no such thing as forever—one day we'll be summoned to heaven.

364
00:27:36,119 --> 00:27:41,619
ペンで書き殴ったこの魂は2PACみたく誰かの心を通過
This soul scribbled down with a pen pierces someone's heart just like 2Pac!

365
00:27:41,919 --> 00:27:46,519
なぁ 何か忘れちゃねぇか 人生まるで映画 皆がエンターテイナー
Hey, haven't you forgotten something? Life is like a movie, everyone's an entertainer!

366
00:27:46,519 --> 00:27:51,319
思い出せ 思想は現実化する 誰がHighway飛ばすBentayga
Remember, thoughts materialize into reality! Who's speeding a Bentayga down the highway?

367
00:27:51,619 --> 00:27:56,619
Ah 胸の奥底 初期衝動
Ah, deep within our chest, that primal impulse...

368
00:27:56,919 --> 00:28:00,419
見て見ぬフリ No, no
Pretending not to notice—no, no!

369
00:28:00,419 --> 00:28:04,919
夢追い 笑われ 傷だらけでギラつく My way
Chasing dreams, laughed at, covered in scars, glaring bright—my way!

370
00:28:04,919 --> 00:28:07,919
Go on! You should know who we are

371
00:28:07,919 --> 00:28:10,319
Forever Young

372
00:28:10,319 --> 00:28:13,119
Hey! 俺達は今日だって
Hey! Even today, we...

373
00:28:13,119 --> 00:28:17,319
若気の至りのような夢を追いかけて来た
...have been chasing after dreams that seemed like youthful folly!

374
00:28:17,319 --> 00:28:19,519
Forever Young

375
00:28:19,519 --> 00:28:22,119
Hey! 変わるはずなんてない
Hey! There's no way we'd ever change!

376
00:28:22,119 --> 00:28:24,319
さぁ 滾ってやろうぜ！
Come on, let's get fired up!

377
00:28:24,319 --> 00:28:28,919
今日は残された人生で 一番若い日だろ
Today is the youngest day of the rest of your life, isn't it?

378
00:28:28,919 --> 00:28:33,119
半端な覚悟ならドブに捨てな (永遠)
If your resolve is half-baked, toss it in the ditch! (Forever)

379
00:28:33,119 --> 00:28:37,119
往生際が悪い テメー笑い飛ばし 誇れBetter days
A sore loser—laugh it off and take pride in better days!

380
00:28:37,119 --> 00:28:41,919
まだ終わらない 終わらせやしない 燃え尽きるまで (永遠)
It's not over yet! We won't let it end until we burn out! (Forever)

381
00:28:41,919 --> 00:28:47,919
まだ終わらない 終わらせやしない くたばるまで (永遠)
It's not over yet! We won't let it end until we drop dead! (Forever)

382
00:28:47,919 --> 00:28:50,119
Forever Young

383
00:28:50,119 --> 00:28:54,919
もう夢を追いかけ本気になった心は
A heart that has become truly serious about chasing dreams

384
00:28:54,919 --> 00:28:57,519
自分の指図も受けない
won't even take orders from itself!

385
00:28:57,519 --> 00:28:59,319
Forever Young

386
00:28:59,319 --> 00:29:04,719
Hey! その思いから逃れられないなら
Hey! If you can't escape from that desire,

387
00:29:04,719 --> 00:29:08,619
自ら向かうだけ
then just charge straight toward it yourself!

388
00:29:08,619 --> 00:29:12,719
終わらせやしない 燃え尽きるまで (永遠)
We won't let it end until we burn out! (Forever)

389
00:29:12,719 --> 00:29:16,919
まだ終わらない 終わらせやしない くたばるまで (永遠)
It's not over yet! We won't let it end until we drop dead! (Forever)

390
00:29:16,919 --> 00:29:18,619
まだ終わらない
It's not over yet!

391
00:29:18,619 --> 00:29:20,119
まだ終わらない
It's not over yet!

392
00:29:20,119 --> 00:29:21,119
Forever Young

393
00:29:21,119 --> 00:29:22,419
Forever Young

394
00:29:22,419 --> 00:29:28,119
そう 今日という日は お前に残された人生の一番若い日
That's right, today is the youngest day of the rest of your life!

395
00:29:36,119 --> 00:29:38,319
イエーイ！
Yay!

396
00:29:38,319 --> 00:29:40,119
マリン来てくれてありがとう！
Marine, thanks for coming!

397
00:29:40,119 --> 00:29:42,619
いや、楽しかった！イエイイエイイエイ！
Man, that was so much fun! Yay, yay, yay!

398
00:29:43,119 --> 00:29:46,919
いや、マジこの「Forever Young」って曲をマリンと一緒に歌いたかったの！
Seriously, I've wanted to sing this song "Forever Young" with Marine so badly!

399
00:29:46,919 --> 00:29:48,619
「Forever Young」って曲をね！
Yeah, the song "Forever Young"!

400
00:29:48,619 --> 00:29:50,119
あー、それはマリンが…
Ah, is that so Marine...

401
00:29:50,119 --> 00:29:52,119
おばさんにならないように？
...doesn't become an old lady?

402
00:29:52,119 --> 00:29:54,919
そう、もうフォーエバーのヤングだから！って言うね！
Exactly! Saying "You're forever young!"

403
00:29:54,919 --> 00:29:57,119
そうだね。永遠にね、ヤング気味で。
That's right. Keeping that youthful feeling forever.

404
00:29:57,119 --> 00:29:59,619
みんな、みんな、Forever Youngだね。
Everyone, everyone is forever young.

405
00:29:59,619 --> 00:30:01,119
みんなヤング！
Everyone is young!

406
00:30:01,119 --> 00:30:02,119
で、マリン…
And Marine...

407
00:30:02,514 --> 00:30:03,614
今日はね、今日ね、
Today, today...

408
00:30:03,614 --> 00:30:05,314
え、後ろ見て？
Hey, look behind us!

409
00:30:05,614 --> 00:30:07,314
演奏してくれた！
They played for us!

410
00:30:07,514 --> 00:30:08,814
気まずいよ
It's awkward!

411
00:30:08,814 --> 00:30:10,414
今日ね、演奏してくれたみんなが...
Everyone who played for us today...

412
00:30:10,414 --> 00:30:11,814
乗ってる、乗ってるよ。
They're grooving, they're into it!

413
00:30:11,814 --> 00:30:14,014
乗ってるでしょ？え、どの子と写真撮りたい？
Right? So, which one do you wanna take a photo with?

414
00:30:14,014 --> 00:30:16,414
え、そんな1人だけみたいな、そんななんか...
Picking just one would feel kind of...

415
00:30:16,414 --> 00:30:18,614
いや、2人選んでいい、2人選んでいい。
No, you can pick two! Pick two!

416
00:30:18,614 --> 00:30:20,714
かわいそうだろ選ばれない奴！
I'd feel bad for the one left out!

417
00:30:20,714 --> 00:30:21,714
2人選ぼう、2人。
Let's pick two, two of them.

418
00:30:21,714 --> 00:30:24,214
これもう、ころねすきーだからさぁ...
But that one's a Koronesuki, so...

419
00:30:24,214 --> 00:30:25,914
いいよ、マリンが選ぶんだよ。
It's fine, you're the one choosing, Marine.

420
00:30:25,914 --> 00:30:27,214
あ、マリンが...
Ah, I choose...

421
00:30:27,214 --> 00:30:28,714
最初は...
The first one is...

422
00:30:28,714 --> 00:30:31,214
待って、映して後ろ。
Wait, show them in the back.

423
00:30:31,214 --> 00:30:34,214
みんな下向いて。
Everyone, look down.

424
00:30:38,214 --> 00:30:39,914
細犬さん。
Thin Dog-san.

425
00:30:41,714 --> 00:30:43,714
かわいい！ / かわいい。
So cute! / Cute.

426
00:30:43,714 --> 00:30:46,414
じゃあ細犬...まず細犬と写真撮ろっか。
Let's take a photo with Thin Dog first.

427
00:30:46,414 --> 00:30:48,214
かわいいよ、細犬。
Thin Dog is so cute.

428
00:30:48,214 --> 00:30:49,914
こっちおいでマリン。 / こっちでいいね。
Come over here, Marine. / Over here, right?

429
00:30:49,914 --> 00:30:52,214
はい、細犬です。えっと、細犬はギターかな？
Here's Thin Dog. Is Thin Dog on guitar?

430
00:30:53,714 --> 00:30:55,814
ギターですか？細犬ちゃん。
Are you on guitar, Thin Dog-chan?

431
00:30:55,814 --> 00:30:57,514
ベロの色が... / かわいいね。
The tongue color is... / Cute, right?

432
00:30:57,514 --> 00:30:59,214
乾いてるベロ。
The tongue is dry.

433
00:30:59,214 --> 00:31:01,214
ベロ乾いちゃっ...死んでるんだけど、ベロの色がね。
The tongue is dry... It's dead, but the tongue color...

434
00:31:01,214 --> 00:31:02,714
あ、これ乾いてる。
Ah, it's definitely dry.

435
00:31:02,714 --> 00:31:05,214
乾いてる。あんま触んないでね。
It's dry. Don't touch it too much.

436
00:31:05,214 --> 00:31:07,214
ごめんね、いっぱい触って。
Sorry for touching you so much.

437
00:31:07,214 --> 00:31:09,214
次誰がいい？あと1人、あと1人。
Who's next? One more, one more!

438
00:31:09,214 --> 00:31:10,514
じゃあ... / 太犬？ / 太犬。
Then... / Fat Dog? / Fat Dog.

439
00:31:10,514 --> 00:31:11,714
太犬だね。
Fat Dog it is.

440
00:31:11,714 --> 00:31:14,514
太犬はドラムです。かわいい！
Fat Dog is on drums. So cute!

441
00:31:14,514 --> 00:31:16,214
太犬！でかい！
Fat Dog! It's huge!

442
00:31:16,214 --> 00:31:19,014
かわいいね。
So cute.

443
00:31:19,214 --> 00:31:23,214
ベロの色がちょっと明るい。
Its tongue color is a bit brighter...

444
00:31:23,214 --> 00:31:24,714
細犬より。
...than Thin Dog's.

445
00:31:24,714 --> 00:31:26,714
撮った？みんな撮った？ / 撮った？
Got the shot? Did everyone take a photo? / Got it?

446
00:31:26,714 --> 00:31:28,714
かわいい！
So cute!

447
00:31:28,714 --> 00:31:30,214
オッケーだね。うん、オッケー。
All good, right? Yep, okay!

448
00:31:30,214 --> 00:31:33,214
え、じゃあ最後さ、2人でも撮ろうよ、2人でも。
Hey, let's take one with just the two of us at the end!

449
00:31:33,214 --> 00:31:35,214
あ、そうだね！2人でも撮ろう、2人でも。
Ah, good idea! Let's take one with just the two of us.

450
00:31:35,214 --> 00:31:36,714
マリン立って。
Marine, stand up.

451
00:31:41,214 --> 00:31:44,714
あ、ごめんごめん！ / やっぱり撮りたいみたいだから...
Ah, sorry, sorry! / It looks like they want one too...

452
00:31:44,714 --> 00:31:47,214
あ、やっぱりね、ころねすきーともね。
Ah, of course, with the Koronesuki too.

453
00:31:47,214 --> 00:31:50,214
撮りますか。ころねすきー、ころさん好き？
Shall we? Koronesuki, do you like Koro-san?

454
00:31:50,214 --> 00:31:52,714
好き？ころさん好き？
Do you? Do you like Koro-san?

455
00:31:52,714 --> 00:31:55,214
あ、よかった。 / え、マリンも好き？
Ah, good! / Do you like Marine too?

456
00:31:55,214 --> 00:31:57,414
間に入ろう。 / なんでだよ！
Let's stand between them. / Why would you do that?!

457
00:31:57,414 --> 00:32:01,214
ころねすきーなのに、ころさんの隣に立てない気分どう？
How does it feel to be a Koronesuki and not be able to stand next to Koro-san?

458
00:32:01,214 --> 00:32:04,014
嬉しい？マリンが隣でいいね？
Happy? Aren't you glad to have Marine next to you?

459
00:32:04,014 --> 00:32:07,214
嬉しくない！？本当は好きなんでしょ？
You're not happy?! You secretly love it, don't you?

460
00:32:07,214 --> 00:32:09,214
やめろ！やめろよ！
Stop it! Cut it out!

461
00:32:09,214 --> 00:32:11,214
だめ、もうだめ、帰るよ。帰るよもう。 / 帰ろう。
No way, I'm heading home. I'm leaving. / Let's go.

462
00:32:11,214 --> 00:32:14,514
はい、今日はね、このバンドメンバーがいましたけれどもですね... / ええ。
Alright, we had our band members here today, but... / Yeah.

463
00:32:14,514 --> 00:32:17,214
え、マリンとも最後撮りたい！ / あ、撮ろう撮ろう。せっかくだね。
I wanna take one last photo with Marine! / Let's do it! Since we're here!

464
00:32:17,214 --> 00:32:20,214
フォーエバーヤングだから、今日は。
Because we're forever young today!

465
00:32:20,214 --> 00:32:24,214
ねえ、マイク！ / マイク！
Hey, the mic! / The mic!

466
00:32:24,214 --> 00:32:27,714
間違えて...色々間違えちゃってるけどさ、マイクね。うん、いいよいいよ。
You've got it all mixed up, but yeah, the mic. It's fine, it's fine!

467
00:32:27,714 --> 00:32:29,914
デカい声で喋れば拾うから。
It'll pick up if I talk loudly anyway.

468
00:32:29,914 --> 00:32:31,714
ね、こうやってね。撮れた？
Yeah, like this. Got it?

469
00:32:31,714 --> 00:32:34,214
いけてる？ / 太犬...
Looking good? / Fat Dog...

470
00:32:34,214 --> 00:32:36,714
中心として...
Centering on it...

471
00:32:36,714 --> 00:32:38,714
笑顔笑顔！撮れたね？ / うん！
Smile, smile! We got it, right? / Yep!

472
00:32:38,714 --> 00:32:40,414
ありがとう、マリン！ / ありがとう！
Thank you, Marine! / Thank you!

473
00:32:40,414 --> 00:32:43,214
ころねちょっと次の曲があるから行くけど... / 次の曲、うん。
I have to get ready for the next song, so I gotta go... / Next song, yeah.

474
00:32:43,214 --> 00:32:46,214
1人で帰れる？ / おー、え、大丈夫、大丈夫大丈夫。
Can you make it back alone? / Oh, yeah, I'll be fine, totally fine!

475
00:32:46,214 --> 00:32:48,714
じゃあ、バンドメンバーのことよろしく。 / え？
Alright, take care of the band members! / Huh?

476
00:32:48,714 --> 00:32:50,714
じゃあ、マリンばいばい！
Bye-bye, Marine!

477
00:32:50,714 --> 00:32:53,214
え？よろしくって何よよろしく...
Huh? What do you mean "take care of them"...

478
00:32:53,214 --> 00:32:56,014
え、どんなムードこれ？あ、え？え？
What kind of mood is this? Wait, huh? Huh?

479
00:32:56,014 --> 00:32:59,214
みんな、あ、そしてみんな、次の曲でーす！
Everyone... and now, everyone, here's the next song!

480
00:33:02,514 --> 00:33:06,714
なぁ なぁ なぁ...
Na na na...

481
00:33:07,814 --> 00:33:12,914
サボり方とか 甘え方とか 逃げ方とか 言い訳の仕方とか
How to slack off, how to depend on others, how to run away, how to make excuses,

482
00:33:12,914 --> 00:33:18,414
